{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wizards are waging war among the skies to conquer a shattered world. Lay claim to your skyshard and <strong>build a city</strong> full of magical buildings and enchanted weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/9389fcc90f5bd684faef7897058aaa8f.poster.avif?t=1765473004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/9389fcc90f5bd684faef7897058aaa8f.webm?t=1765473004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/9389fcc90f5bd684faef7897058aaa8f.mp4?t=1765473004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Building and Battling</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SkyShard is a fantasy city-building auto-battler where you\u2019ll need to outsmart your opponents by assembling the most powerful city you can. It will take a combination of careful <strong>resource management</strong> and planning to acquire the right buildings for your town, along with <strong>clever positioning</strong> of your buildings to unlock surprising and potent effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/37e15ed93e55bb2fc3c113ea74300cd6.poster.avif?t=1765473004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/37e15ed93e55bb2fc3c113ea74300cd6.webm?t=1765473004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/37e15ed93e55bb2fc3c113ea74300cd6.mp4?t=1765473004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your town grows, other players will attack with their own skyshards, and you\u2019ll need to survive 16 rounds to win. Sometimes they\u2019ll surprise you with a humbling defeat, but that\u2019s the best way to learn! With <strong>asynchronous PVP</strong>, there\u2019s absolutely no time pressure. You can take as long as you like to arrange your city perfectly.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the wisest wizards can achieve a perfect victory or <strong>climb the leaderboard</strong> and achieve the rank of Archmage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/98bbd9408c619720ac15bb16b030a34c.poster.avif?t=1765473004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/98bbd9408c619720ac15bb16b030a34c.webm?t=1765473004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/98bbd9408c619720ac15bb16b030a34c.mp4?t=1765473004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Buildings and Synergies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of SkyShard, you\u2019ll encounter buildings from a <strong>variety of factions</strong>, each with their own special abilities, and embracing them all can give you a big advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Tinker faction uses gnomish technology to make buildings operate at <strong>peak efficiency</strong>, but it can definitely backfire.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/dc992df1ec2c0d2289faa4a4c22544c2.poster.avif?t=1765473004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/dc992df1ec2c0d2289faa4a4c22544c2.webm?t=1765473004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/dc992df1ec2c0d2289faa4a4c22544c2.mp4?t=1765473004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic harnesses <strong>explosive powers</strong> that can deal lots of damage to entire neighborhoods.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/a04b776ed14cc2231cad68303638bc01.poster.avif?t=1765473004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/a04b776ed14cc2231cad68303638bc01.webm?t=1765473004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/a04b776ed14cc2231cad68303638bc01.mp4?t=1765473004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nature is all about <strong>gaining health</strong> and staying alive, even against the most aggressive enemies.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/474269d68044253c57b55ae1b4f0fc7b.poster.avif?t=1765473004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/474269d68044253c57b55ae1b4f0fc7b.webm?t=1765473004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/474269d68044253c57b55ae1b4f0fc7b.mp4?t=1765473004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll encounter even more factions, with <strong>over a hundred unique buildings</strong> with diverse and formidable effects to discover.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Truly Independent</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We made SkyShard to be a game that puts players first. We\u2019re two meager strategy-gaming YouTubers, ItsBen321 and RegisKillbin, who got tired of games always making decisions that were focused on monetization and forced engagement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So we decided to put our money and time where our mouths are, and make our own game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We might make some mistakes along the way, this is our first game after all, but we\u2019ll always be around on YouTube and Twitch, listening to players, and working to make the game better and keeping players updated on our thoughts, plans, challenges, and triumphs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you get out there and build an amazing city, while we go and build an awesome game!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3892910?t=1765473004","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/00942585894f77fe8998a05f7e463765ff3bdc62/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765473004","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/bb0bea4cbb676541dde877ae91be2c5c532cddda/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765473004","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/bb0bea4cbb676541dde877ae91be2c5c532cddda/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765473004","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3989770,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wizards are waging war among the skies to conquer a shattered world. Lay claim to your skyshard and <strong>build a city</strong> full of magical buildings and enchanted weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/9389fcc90f5bd684faef7897058aaa8f.poster.avif?t=1765473004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/9389fcc90f5bd684faef7897058aaa8f.webm?t=1765473004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/9389fcc90f5bd684faef7897058aaa8f.mp4?t=1765473004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Building and Battling</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SkyShard is a fantasy city-building auto-battler where you\u2019ll need to outsmart your opponents by assembling the most powerful city you can. It will take a combination of careful <strong>resource management</strong> and planning to acquire the right buildings for your town, along with <strong>clever positioning</strong> of your buildings to unlock surprising and potent effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/37e15ed93e55bb2fc3c113ea74300cd6.poster.avif?t=1765473004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/37e15ed93e55bb2fc3c113ea74300cd6.webm?t=1765473004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/37e15ed93e55bb2fc3c113ea74300cd6.mp4?t=1765473004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your town grows, other players will attack with their own skyshards, and you\u2019ll need to survive 16 rounds to win. Sometimes they\u2019ll surprise you with a humbling defeat, but that\u2019s the best way to learn! With <strong>asynchronous PVP</strong>, there\u2019s absolutely no time pressure. You can take as long as you like to arrange your city perfectly.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the wisest wizards can achieve a perfect victory or <strong>climb the leaderboard</strong> and achieve the rank of Archmage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/98bbd9408c619720ac15bb16b030a34c.poster.avif?t=1765473004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/98bbd9408c619720ac15bb16b030a34c.webm?t=1765473004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/98bbd9408c619720ac15bb16b030a34c.mp4?t=1765473004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Buildings and Synergies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of SkyShard, you\u2019ll encounter buildings from a <strong>variety of factions</strong>, each with their own special abilities, and embracing them all can give you a big advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Tinker faction uses gnomish technology to make buildings operate at <strong>peak efficiency</strong>, but it can definitely backfire.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/dc992df1ec2c0d2289faa4a4c22544c2.poster.avif?t=1765473004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/dc992df1ec2c0d2289faa4a4c22544c2.webm?t=1765473004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/dc992df1ec2c0d2289faa4a4c22544c2.mp4?t=1765473004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic harnesses <strong>explosive powers</strong> that can deal lots of damage to entire neighborhoods.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/a04b776ed14cc2231cad68303638bc01.poster.avif?t=1765473004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/a04b776ed14cc2231cad68303638bc01.webm?t=1765473004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/a04b776ed14cc2231cad68303638bc01.mp4?t=1765473004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nature is all about <strong>gaining health</strong> and staying alive, even against the most aggressive enemies.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/474269d68044253c57b55ae1b4f0fc7b.poster.avif?t=1765473004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/474269d68044253c57b55ae1b4f0fc7b.webm?t=1765473004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892910/extras/474269d68044253c57b55ae1b4f0fc7b.mp4?t=1765473004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll encounter even more factions, with <strong>over a hundred unique buildings</strong> with diverse and formidable effects to discover.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Truly Independent</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We made SkyShard to be a game that puts players first. We\u2019re two meager strategy-gaming YouTubers, ItsBen321 and RegisKillbin, who got tired of games always making decisions that were focused on monetization and forced engagement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So we decided to put our money and time where our mouths are, and make our own game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We might make some mistakes along the way, this is our first game after all, but we\u2019ll always be around on YouTube and Twitch, listening to players, and working to make the game better and keeping players updated on our thoughts, plans, challenges, and triumphs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you get out there and build an amazing city, while we go and build an awesome game!</p>","developers":["ItsBen321","RegisKillbin"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app